[ti:(untitled)]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:17.67]Ra... a... a... a...
[00:32.16]Mere yaar...
[00:37.00]Dekh mere yaar, yu... sapne mein aana chhod de..
[00:41.83]Rahya nahi jaave, mane yu satana chhod de..
[00:56.33]He Ra a a a, mere yaar pyaare,
[01:01.16]He Ra a a a..., dildaar pyaare,
[01:06.00]Tere sang sootre laage,
[01:10.83]Laage ambar saje sitare,,
[01:15.66]He Ra Ra Ra Ra.. Ra...
[01:30.16]Ambar kalgi tere dheer ki,
[01:34.99]Bas tu bharosa jodh de......
[01:44.66]Nahi toh ra jaan ke pyaare, yun satana chhod de,,
[01:49.49]Dekh mere yaar, sapne mein aana chhod de,,
[01:54.32]Jeen de tu maine, yun raatein thaana chhod de,,,
[02:13.66]Kade ya kahaani teri, mere sang bahi paave,
[02:18.49]Dhoonk ya bhitar ki, tan kha jaave,
[02:23.32]Kha jaave aatma ke, dheeramdheer ne,
[02:28.16]Maati ka kaal re bande... Maati ke ameer ne..
[02:37.82]Laage yu duppta.. kaatilana chhod de,
[02:42.65]Mane mere pyaar, yun satana chhod de,
[02:47.49]Dekh mere yaar sapne mein aana chhod de,
[03:01.99]Tohi jaaun tane main sabke hi beech mein,
[03:06.82]Phirun main chamakta, is pher kheech mein,
[03:11.65]Tere te toh mil lyun, aankhein meech meech mein,
[03:21.32]Titli के pankha mein tu, aangli के tanka mein tu,
[03:26.15]Mere saare anka mein tu, khet mein tu, kanka mein tu,
[03:40.65]Jeth mahine mein deh sulgana chhod de..
[03:45.48]Jeen de tu mane sapne mein aana chhod de...
[03:55.15]Mit jaunga main saara, tu roj meetana chhod de..
[04:04.81]Chhod de na mere yaar......
